1.12.m:
Bhīṣma said:
How did the lunar dynasty arise? Tell me, O skilled one;
in that dynasty there were famous kings who increased their renown.

Pulastya said:
Formerly, in ancient times, Atri was commanded by Brahmā in the procedure of creation;
thereupon the omnipresent lord performed austerity for the sake of creation.

